        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)">高频坑：</span>变量名 dBZ/V/ZDR/RHO/KDP 大小写敏感；CAPPI 的 level_height 单位是米；HCL 必须传 band；apply_dualpol_qc 默认返回新对象。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)">示例：</span>H:\hn\PyCWR讲课与实习\pycwr实习2026\case 01~04（read / QC / HCL / 风场）。</p>
      </content>
